This is a really great feature to implement, but I wonder if we can make it more ergonomic.

----

Let's investigate the current approach first (3.).

Every user must add

```rust
    #[cfg(target_arch = "wasm32")]
    fn as_any_mut(&mut self) -> &mut dyn Any {
        &mut *self
    }
```

