Fix to build workspace for web platform: `web/Cargo.toml` 
```diff
- dioxus = { workspace = true, features = ["router"] }
+ dioxus = { workspace = true, features = ["router", "fullstack"] }
```
Error in `api/src/lib.rs` does not affect this build.

But error can be fixed by enabling "browser" feature for server_fn in `api/Cargo.toml`
```diff
+ server_fn = { version = "0.8.2", features = ["browser"] }
```

